  1965                                  ; .ce_render: the single redraw routine every cmd_edit navigation/edit
  1966                                  ; op calls afterward. Scrolls r12 (top row) just enough to keep the
  1967                                  ; cursor (r13) on screen, clears and redraws the header + the visible
  1968                                  ; slice of fs_io_buf, and leaves the hardware cursor sitting exactly on
  1969                                  ; r13's screen cell. O(visible page + scan-to-cursor) per call rather
  1970                                  ; than O(1), which is fine for a polled-keyboard editor. Clobbers
  1971                                  ; rax/rbx/rcx/rdx/rsi/rdi/r8/r9/r11.
