  2986                                  ; ============================================================
  2987                                  ;  cmd_run_back: "run <file>.run -back". Starts a compiled .run
  2988                                  ;  program as a background process. The .run binary embeds its whole
  2989                                  ;  Party source (after a 3-line header + the 14-byte entry stub), so
  2990                                  ;  we copy that source into the process's own buffer, lex + collect
  2991                                  ;  functions right here (so syntax/collection errors are reported
  2992                                  ;  immediately), park the resulting interpreter state into the
  2993                                  ;  process's save area, and leave it for the idle scheduler to step.
  2994                                  ;  Enters with r12 = pointer to the entry stub in fs_io_buf.
  2995                                  ; ============================================================
