  5420                                  ; cmd_sys: "sys reset" - a factory reset for when a user's system is
  5421                                  ; broken/full/messed up. Wipes every file and folder on the OS volume
  5422                                  ; (nodes 0..OS_NODES-1 - mounted external drives are untouched), clears
  5423                                  ; the in-memory variables and aliases, recreates the default system
  5424                                  ; files (sys/, alias.sly, sysconfig - see ensure_sys_folder), and saves
  5425                                  ; the result to disk immediately. Requires auth: "auth sys reset".
