  5458                                  ; sys_do_reset: the actual factory-reset work for "sys reset". Keeps the
  5459                                  ; OS volume's existing label (so the drive/system identity doesn't
  5460                                  ; change), but wipes every node in its slice (nodes 0..OS_NODES-1) back
  5461                                  ; to a single empty root folder, drops all session variables and
  5462                                  ; aliases, recreates the default sys/ files, and persists it all to
  5463                                  ; disk. Mounted external drives live in nodes OS_NODES..MAX_NODES-1 and
  5464                                  ; are left completely untouched.
