  6310                                  ; bg_scheduler_tick: steps every running background process once.
  6311                                  ; Called from the shell's idle path (read_char_or_step) when no key is
  6312                                  ; waiting, so background scripts run exactly when the shell would
  6313                                  ; otherwise be sitting at the prompt. Finishing processes have their
  6314                                  ; completion notice queued (bg_finish_notice) and their slots freed.
