  6469                                  ;  cmd_rr: run a rush script file
  6470                                  ;  Usage: rr <filename.rsh>
  6471                                  ;  Creates a process called "runrush <filename>" with a PID.
  6472                                  ;  Executes each line of the file as a rush command. Lines
  6473                                  ;  starting with $ are treated as comments and skipped.
