  6971                                  ; ============================================================
  6972                                  ;  cmd_auth: elevation system (like sudo).
  6973                                  ;  Usage: auth <command> [args...]
  6974                                  ;  Sets auth_valid, shifts arguments (arg1->cmd, arg2->arg1, etc.),
  6975                                  ;  then dispatches the command with elevated privileges.
  6976                                  ;  auth_valid is reset after the command returns.
  6977                                  ; ============================================================
