  7581                                  ; Reads /home/sys/alias.sly and feeds each line through the same
  7582                                  ; try_handle_ali_line parser interactive "ali ..." typing uses, so the
  7583                                  ; on-disk format and the live command can never drift apart. Sets
  7584                                  ; alias_loading so alias_store doesn't immediately re-persist every
  7585                                  ; single line it's busy restoring.
