 10792 00018C35 66C70425[1AE90500]-         mov word [nic_dns_id], 1
 10792 00018C3D 0100               
 10793 00018C3F 66C70425[0EE90500]-         mov word [nic_echo_id], 0x1234
 10793 00018C47 3412               
