 11294                                  ; nic_shutdown -- Bring the active NIC down (stop TX/RX, soft reset).
 11295                                  ;              Called by "net off" and "net reset". After calling
 11296                                  ;              this, nic_present is 0 and nic_driver_type is 0 so
 11297                                  ;              every network command will just print "no NIC".
