 11722                                      ; Cross-check against ISR TOK (bit2, Transmit OK) as a second, independent
 11723                                      ; completion signal. Field diagnostics (netdiag_dump_tx) have shown this
 11724                                      ; chip family occasionally leaving the polled descriptor's OWN bit (and
 11725                                      ; even its length field) in a state this driver's simple C+-descriptor
 11726                                      ; model doesn't expect, while the PCI bus itself reports no abort/parity
 11727                                      ; fault at all - i.e. the frame most likely did go out, but the
 11728                                      ; descriptor-bit poll alone can't always see it. TOK is the standard,
 11729                                      ; documented r8169 completion indicator and is independent of that
