  1066                              <1> ; ------------------------------------------------------------
  1067                              <1> ; party_exec_stmts: runs statements starting at token r13 until it
  1068                              <1> ; reaches a token whose type equals r14 (TOK_EOF for the top level,
  1069                              <1> ; TOK_RBRACE for a block body). Does NOT consume the stop token.
  1070                              <1> ; Recurses into itself for if/while/else blocks. Exits early (with
  1071                              <1> ; r13 wherever it stopped) when an error is set, the script is
  1072                              <1> ; killed (Esc), or a `return` is unwinding (party_returning).
  1073                              <1> ; In: r13 = starting token index, r14 = stop token type.
  1074                              <1> ; Clobbers rax, rbx, r8-r11; preserves r13 (advances it), r14.
