  1601                              <1> ; party_skip_balanced_parens: r13 must point at '('; advances r13
  1602                              <1> ; to the matching ')' (not consumed), handling nested parens.
  1603                              <1> ; Clobbers rax, rbx, rcx.
  1604                              <1> ; ------------------------------------------------------------
