  1770                              <1> ; ------------------------------------------------------------
  1771                              <1> ; party_reset_runtime: resets the shared global interpreter state
  1772                              <1> ; (value stack, variable/locals/frame tables, flags, x87 FPU) to a
  1773                              <1> ; fresh pre-run condition, exactly like party_exec initializes on
  1774                              <1> ; entry. Used before lexing+collecting a compiled .run program so a
  1775                              <1> ; previous party/run leaves no stale state behind. Clobbers rdi, rsi,
  1776                              <1> ; rcx, rax and the FPU.
  1777                              <1> ; ------------------------------------------------------------
  1778                              <1> party_reset_runtime:
  1779 0001CC66 53                  <1>     push rbx
