  2475                              <1> ; ------------------------------------------------------------
  2476                              <1> ; party_parse_call: parses a function call. In: r13 = '(' following
  2477                              <1> ; the function-name token (name text already in party_ident_buf).
  2478                              <1> ; Evaluates args (pushing each), checks arity, invokes the function,
  2479                              <1> ; and leaves the result value on the value stack with r13 just past
  2480                              <1> ; the closing ')'. Clobbers rax, rbx, r8-r14.
  2481                              <1> ; ------------------------------------------------------------
