  3039                              <1> ;  VARIABLES
  3040                              <1> ; ============================================================
  3041                              <1> ; Globals live in party_var_* (fixed MAXVARS slots). A function's
  3042                              <1> ; locals live in the party_loc_* pool as a contiguous run from the
  3043                              <1> ; frame's locbase to the pool end; a call frame remembers where its
  3044                              <1> ; run starts so it can be freed on return. Lookup searches the
  3045                              <1> ; current frame's run first, then globals.
  3046                              <1> 
