   483                              <1> ; and a snapshot of those cells (char+attr) is kept so the highlight can
   484                              <1> ; be removed exactly when the drag moves or the screen is rewritten.
   485                              <1> ; sel_valid marks a finalized selection that Ctrl+C copies into clip_buf
   486                              <1> ; (one line per screen row, trailing spaces trimmed, newline separated).
   487                              <1> ; Ctrl+V pastes clip_buf back into the command line via KEY_PASTE.
   488                              <1> 
