 15545                                  ; ============================================================
 15546                                  ;  SCROLLBACK VIEW (Ctrl+Up / Ctrl+Down)
 15547                                  ; ============================================================
 15548                                  ; All of these routines save/restore every register they use, so they are
 15549                                  ; safe to call from anywhere inside get_char without disturbing a caller
 15550                                  ; like read_line that keeps its own state (buffer ptr/length/max) in
 15551                                  ; r8/r9/r10 across get_char calls.
 15552                                  
 15553                                  ; scrollback_capture_row: archives the current row 0 (about to be shifted
 15554                                  ; off by scroll_screen) into the scrollback ring buffer.
 15555                                  scrollback_capture_row:
 15556 0002CEF7 50                          push rax
 15557 0002CEF8 51                          push rcx
 15558 0002CEF9 56                          push rsi
 15559 0002CEFA 57                          push rdi
 15560                                  
