 15586                                  ; scrollback_render: al = desired scroll offset (0 = live). Clamps to
 15587                                  ; [0, sb_count], stores the clamped value in scroll_offset, and redraws
 15588                                  ; VGA_BASE either as the pure live screen (from live_snapshot) or as a
 15589                                  ; composite of scrollback_buf + live_snapshot. Parks the hardware cursor
 15590                                  ; off-screen while scrolled back, since it belongs to the live line the
