 15865                                  ; .remove_at_cursor: deletes the buffer byte at index r11, shifting
 15866                                  ; everything after it left by one, and decrements r8. Does not touch the
 15867                                  ; screen or r11 itself - callers handle cursor movement/redraw. Clobbers
 15868                                  ; rax/rdx.
 15869                                  .remove_at_cursor:
 15870 0002D1DF 50                          push rax
