 15883 0002D1FD 5A                          pop rdx
 15884 0002D1FE 58                          pop rax
 15885 0002D1FF C3                          ret
 15886                                  
 15887                                  ; .insert_char (in: al = character to insert at the cursor). Shifts
 15888                                  ; buf[r11..r8-1] right by one, stores al at r9+r11, redraws the
 15889                                  ; widened tail, and advances r11/the screen cursor past the inserted
 15890                                  ; character. No-op if the buffer is already full. Clobbers
 15891                                  ; rax/rbx/rcx/rdx/rsi/rdi; updates r8/r11.
 15892                                  .insert_char:
