 16134                                  ; ============================================================
 16135                                  ;  complete_line: Tab completion for the rush prompt. Called from
 16136                                  ;  read_line when the user presses Tab.
 16137                                  ;  - first token on the line: completes against the built-in command
 16138                                  ;    table (completion_cmds)
 16139                                  ;  - any later token: completes against the names of files/folders
 16140                                  ;    directly inside cur_dir
 16141                                  ;  A single unique match is completed in place (commands get a trailing
 16142                                  ;  space, folders a trailing '/'); an ambiguous prefix is extended as
 16143                                  ;  far as all candidates agree, and if the prefix is already as long as
 16144                                  ;  the shared portion, the candidates are listed and the prompt and
 16145                                  ;  line are reprinted.
 16146                                  ;  Preserves r9/r10; r8 (current line length) may grow as characters
 16147                                  ;  are completed, which is exactly what read_line expects.
 16148                                  ; ============================================================
 16149                                  complete_line:
 16150 0002D49C 50                          push rax
 16151 0002D49D 53                          push rbx
 16152 0002D49E 51                          push rcx
 16153 0002D49F 52                          push rdx
 16154 0002D4A0 56                          push rsi
 16155 0002D4A1 57                          push rdi
 16156 0002D4A2 4153                        push r11
 16157 0002D4A4 4154                        push r12
 16158 0002D4A6 4155                        push r13
 16159 0002D4A8 4156                        push r14
